    "basic": {
      "name": {
        "en": "Plasma Forge"
      },
      "desc": {
        "en": "Isabella attacks the enemy with a plasma reflector, dealing Ice DMG and gaining energy. Energy cannot exceed maximum capacity. / Energy is also gained upon using Evasion Counter. However, energy can't be gained with Evasion Counter while Cooling Cycle is active. / When energy reaches a certain level, Isabella's Basic Attack's 4th Hit is triggered. While it's active, DMG Taken decreases and hit enemies are inflicted with Freeze. Also, Isabella's Charge Attack leads to Basic Attack's 4th Hit. / When Isabella remains on the field and attacks enemies after using her Tag-out Skill, she uses her Basic Attack's 3rd and 5th Hit. Enemies hit by her Basic Attack's 5th Hit have their Neutralization RES decreased. / Isabella cannot gain energy with her Basic Attack when she's not being actively controlled."
      },
